# Only build output stays out of the Docker context. Tracked directories must go in: the version string is derived
# from git inside the container, and a context missing tracked files (as .githooks, .github and Tools were until
# 2026-09-19) made every Docker-built server report a "-dirty" version the clients then refused.
.xmake/*
Services/*
build/*
vsxmake/*
vs*/*
package/*
